-- statement:
--   **Block solve error.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegBlk`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.blkI_err {T : Tables} {a n : ℕ} {E B Dm : ℝ} (hα : 2 ≤ α) (hσ : 1 ≤ σ)
--       (hx : 2 ≤ α ^ 2 * (σ - 1)) (hb : |b| ≤ 1 / 2) (hT : BlkTab P α σ b T a n E)
--       (hE : 0 ≤ E) (hB : 0 ≤ B) (hDm : ∀ u < n, ddR α σ u ≤ Dm)
--       (hP : 8 * (((n : ℝ) + 1) * E + 1) * (B + 1) ≤ 2 ^ P)
--       (z : ℕ → ℤ) (hz : ∀ u < n, |(z u : ℝ) / 2 ^ P| ≤ B) :
--       ∀ u < n, |(blkI P T a n z u : ℝ) / 2 ^ P - blkE α σ b n (fun k => (z k : ℝ) / 2 ^ P) u| ≤
--         9 * Dm * (((n : ℝ) + 1) * E + 1) * (B + 1) / 2 ^ P
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Segmented inverse (S2): fixed-point error of one block solve and of single `M⁻¹` entries
--
--   * `sum_stage`: one rounded linear stage `rs P (Σ c̃_k x̃_k)` against the exact `Σ c_k x_k`.
--   * `blkI_err` (report L7/L10 block part): with tables accurate to `E` ulps (`dd` to relative
--     `E` ulps), input `|z| ≤ 2^P B`, `Dm ≥ max_u D_u` and `8 K (B+1) ≤ 2^P`, `K = (n+1)E + 1`:
--     `|blkI z / 2^P - M_c⁻¹ (z/2^P)| ≤ 9 Dm K (B+1) / 2^P`.
--   * `TinvI_err`, `MinvI_err`: single entries of `T⁻¹` (direct or persymmetric) and of `M⁻¹`.
